                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mu_S: S S X\to S X
            are mutually inverse. This makes
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi S
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S
            an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+monad"} idempotent
            submonad of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Giry+monad"} Giry monad
          %h3#kleisli_category Kleisli category
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kleisli+category"} Kleisli category
            of the monad
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi S
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S
            is the category of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/measurable+spaces"} measurable spaces
            and
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/zero-one+kernels"} zero-one kernels
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi Stoch
                      %mi det
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Stoch_det
          %p
            Since the monad is
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+monad"} idempotent
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+of+categories"} equivalent
            to its
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eilenberg-Moore+category"} Eilenberg-Moore category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
