          %p
            Let’s now write this equivalence explicitly. One one side, define the functor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
                  %mo :
                  %mi SoberMeas
                  %mo →
                  %msub
                    %mi Stoch
                    %mi det
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F:SoberMeas\to Stoch_det
            as follows:
          %ul
            %li
              On
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/objects"} objects
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sober+measurable+spaces"} sober measurable spaces
              to all measurable spaces).
            %li
